t_version(); :284 gc_schema_for() branching on BuildKit major/minor","docker-storage-cap.sh:45 header frames the engine-keyed logic as 'an earlier revision ... (bug 3057)'"],"finding":"The plan asserts docker-storage-cap.sh currently keys the GC schema off the Docker Engine version, citing `80: DOCKER_MODERN_GC_MAJOR=25`, `184: probe_engine_version()`, `194: gc_schema_for() # major >= 25 -> \"modern\"`, and `249: gc[\"maxUsedSpace\"] = cap`. A Read/Grep of the file refutes every one: there is no DOCKER_MODERN_GC_MAJOR and no probe_engine_version (search returns no matches); the file instead defines DOCKER_MODERN_GC_BUILDKIT_MAJOR=0/MINOR=13 (lines 88-89), probe_buildkit_version() (line 272), and gc_schema_for() at line 284 (not 194) branching on the BuildKit boundary. The proposed fix ('replace the engine-version discriminator with a BuildKit-version one') is already implemented in the repo.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fd3689a5d7339fe46","impact":0.85,"is_primary":null,"location":"Root cause section, code block citing :80/:184/:194/:249; Approach section","norm_id":"ne7e22f9f73a2fc7c","priority":0.7556,"reason":"veto:cited-reference-inaccurate","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Author executes the plan and finds nothing to change in the discriminator, or re-introduces a regression."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8889,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"no","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"yes","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_im